<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There is Someone who is living for you.</l><l>He is list’ning and responding to you.</l><l>He’s preparing, arranging each circumstance</l><l>To meet every one of your needs.</l><l>There is Someone. Just believe.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There is Someone who is strengthening you.</l><l>He’s sustaining and He’s bearing you through.</l><l>You’re not forgotten. At this moment you’re in His hands.</l><l>He’s ministering what you need.</l><l>Love this Someone and believe.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
